{{Quote|Allows the user to transcend the barrier between life and death, granting an extra life and paranormal abilites.|Shop}}
'''Ghost''' is a {{Rare}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|940,000}} or {{Robux|1,275}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Ghost allows users to fight with cold attacks controlled from the dead. The user can also summon ghostly clones of themselves to attack and confuse enemies, and can rise from the dead by resurrecting as a ghost with 50% of their max health.

