==Overview==
<tabber>
Pros=
{{{!}} class="fandom-table"
{{!}}-

{{!}}'''General'''
* Excellent for grinding and very good for PvP.
* The user will resurrect with 50% of their [[Health|HP]] if the user dies.
** The user also gains i-frames for two seconds after the resurrection.
* Fast cooldowns.
* Small knockback.
* Low mastery requirements.
* Extremely good for PvE, especially considering its price.
{{!}}-

{{!}}'''[Z] Shivering Possession'''
* Good damage.
* Stuns for enough time to combo extend.
* Good mobility.
{{!}}-

{{!}}'''[X] Spectral Release'''
* Good stun.
* Decent [[AoE]].
{{!}}-

{{!}} '''[C] Cries of the Underworld'''
* Great move and deals constant damage.
* Decent range.
* The effect can distort enemies in PvP, leading to them being confused.
{{!}}-

{{!}} '''[V] Ghost Busters'''
* Great damage.
* No end-lag.
* Great for tanking damage for the user.
* Can confuse players to attack the ghosts instead of the user.
* The clones/ghosts' swords will share the [[Enchantments#Unique Enchantments:~:text=Strong,Grip|Strong Grip]] enchantment with the user if they have it on their currently equipped sword.
{{!}}-

{{!}}'''[F] Wandering Soul'''
* Decent speed.
* Useful for travel and escaping.
* Can be used to control the user's ghosts.
{{!}}}

|-|Cons=
{{{!}} class="fandom-table"
{{!}}-

{{!}} '''General'''
* Lacks a good combo starter.
* Moves lack range.
* the finisher of {{Ability|Dragon Talon|Z}} from [[Dragon Talon]] bypasses the Resurrection passive.
{{!}}-

{{!}} '''[Z] Shivering Possession'''
* Hard to control.
** The distance the user travels past the enemy after hitting is inconsistent.
* When using this move when close/mid range away from an [[enemy]], the user may get hit after using the move, which isn't useful for grinding.
* Does not break Instinct.
{{!}}-

{{!}} '''[X] Spectral Release'''
* Close ranged.
{{!}}-

{{!}} '''[C] Cries of the Underworld'''
* Very low range.
* Underwhelming damage.
* Effect applied is only visual.
{{!}}-

{{!}} '''[V] Ghost Busters'''
* Need to be close to enemies for the ghosts to target them.
* 50% reduced damage to players.
* The ghosts can increase the enemy's [[Race Awakening|V4 bar]] quickly.
** May not be useful against V4 [[Cyborg]] users.
* Ghosts do not copy [[Enchantments]], with the exception of Strong Grip.
{{!}}-

{{!}} '''[F] Wandering Soul'''
* Low [[Health]] slows flight.
* Not very good for travelling.
{{!}}}
</tabber>

==Trivia==
* Ghost was reworked in [[Updates/21|Update 21]], where its name was also changed from Revive to its current name.
* The green glow from the passive effect will last forever, even if the user switches to another [[Blox Fruits|fruit]]. It only disappears when they die or exit the game. The green effect can also affect other transformed fruits or moves like unawakened [[Dough]]'s [F] move.
* If the user dies by [[Water]], the resurrection passive will not work. The same is true when resetting your character.
* [[Permanent Blox Fruits|Permanent]] Ghost's icon when stored in the inventory uses [[Revive]]'s icon.
* When player use ghost [Z,F] move , their accessory will become half transparent
* Interestingly, if the user uses '''Ghost Busters''' while using [[Dark Blade]]'s '''[X] Dark Air Slash''', the ghost use the original and non-upgraded version. Even if you have the [[Slayer Skin]] equipped.
** The same said with [[Saber]], [[Bisento]] and possibly [[Triple Dark Blade]].

